  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-opening:annal" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">以輔國將軍、徐州刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-opening:annal:m0010" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>爲安西將軍、持節、都督荊司雍益梁寧六州諸軍事，領護南蠻校尉、荊州刺史。</p>
